review:
Amazing sequel to the Batman: Arkham Asylum that continues confrontations and storylines set in previous installment. This game is truly AAA quality in all departments. It expanded and improved almost every aspect of the gameplay and narrative. I can easily recommend it for almost everybody.

Pros:
- Interesting lore;
- Great pacing;
- Awesome visuals;
- Smooth animations;
- Interesting characters;
- Responsive controls;
- Amazing soundtrack and voice acting;
- Satisfying combat;
- Cool stealth;
- Awesome optimisation;
- Immersive dark atmosphere;
- Interesting story;

Cons:
- Low skill ceiling;
